 "description": "<p>A gray knitted turtleneck with cutout openwork, one size for 40-60 kg. The sweater occupies the space between costume and clothing - warm enough to be an outfit, cut out enough to be a statement.</p>\n<p>The openwork is knitted in rather than cut after the fact, so the edges hold and the garment survives washing. Turtleneck framing with exposed midriff is the contrast that makes the piece.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester knit</li>\n<li>Item type: sweater</li>\n<li>Features: knitted openwork cutouts</li>\n<li>Color: gray</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Wear it with the matching skirts in this category or with your own jeans - it holds up as both.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Gray knitted turtleneck sweater with cutout openwork, one size for 40-60 kg, costume-to-street crossover.</p>\n",
